{
  "about": "The owner's first QR sign-in on 2026-11-08 (docs/adr/0020-oxy-account-login.mdx, the setup assistant's amendment), played: the phone approves, the screen claims the session, and then the link stalls for twenty seconds, Oxy's API answering every request quickly but each answer reaching the screen only once the link is back (`qr.stall_after_claim_ms`), as the ThinkPad's did. The screen as it was waited on the SDK's own work after the sign-in and then said \"Your account couldn't be checked. Try again.\". Now the PIN page comes at once and the whole setup goes on while Oxy is out of reach (nothing in it needs Oxy before the accounts' service), never saying an error, never asking for a second scan.",
